    narr:narration """The organization tracks infrastructure evolution through a series of [definitive platform migration decisions](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_1) that transition from technical proposal to organizational record. As of August 2026, the primary focus is a [shift from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_3) for the analytics pipeline. This change is anchored by [quantified performance and cost justifications](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_2), specifically citing a 10x gain in analytical query speed. The trajectory of this decision shows a hardening process: what begins as an actor's stated intent is subsequently [restated as a formal performance metric](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_4) and augmented with [projected execution timelines](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_5). The graph highlights a tension between the raw, actor-voiced decision and the editorialized summary, where external actors introduce structural constraints like Q3 deadlines that were not present in the original announcement.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_PlatformMigrationDecisions> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_QuantifiedInfrastructureJustification> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Database migration**: PostgreSQL → QuantumDB" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The introduction of a Q3 2026 timeline by an external actor adds a temporal constraint not present in the original decision." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The shift from '10x query performance' to '10x analytical queries' narrows the scope of the justification during restatement." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786180934946_4> ] ;
